graph TB
    subgraph Operator["mcp-lifecycle-operator"]
        direction TB
        Manager["Controller Manager<br/>(Deployment)<br/>leader-elect, secure metrics"]
        Reconciler["MCPServerReconciler<br/>(controller-runtime)"]
        TLSConfig["TLS Config<br/>(TLS_MIN_VERSION, cipher suites)"]
        Metrics["Metrics Server<br/>:8443/TCP HTTPS"]
        HealthProbes["Health Probes<br/>:8081/TCP HTTP"]

        Manager --> Reconciler
        Manager --> TLSConfig
        Manager --> Metrics
        Manager --> HealthProbes
    end

    User[Platform User] -->|creates| MCPServerCR["MCPServer CR<br/>(mcp.x-k8s.io/v1alpha1)"]
    MCPServerCR -->|watched by| Reconciler

    subgraph ManagedResources["Managed Resources (per MCPServer)"]
        Deployment["Deployment<br/>(MCP server container)"]
        Service["Service<br/>(session affinity)"]
        NetworkPolicy["NetworkPolicy<br/>(ingress restriction)"]
    end

    Reconciler -->|creates/updates| Deployment
    Reconciler -->|creates/updates| Service
    Reconciler -->|creates/updates| NetworkPolicy
    Reconciler -->|MCP handshake| MCPPod["MCP Server Pod<br/>(user-defined port)"]
    Reconciler -->|status update via SSA| MCPServerCR

    Deployment -->|runs| MCPPod

    Reconciler -->|watches metadata| ConfigMaps["ConfigMaps"]
    Reconciler -->|watches metadata| Secrets["Secrets"]
    ConfigMaps -->|config hash change| Reconciler
    Secrets -->|config hash change| Reconciler

    TLSConfig -.->|PROPAGATE_TLS_ENV_VARS| Deployment

    Prometheus["Prometheus"] -->|scrapes| Metrics

    style Manager fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Reconciler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style TLSConfig fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Metrics fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style HealthProbes fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style MCPServerCR fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style Deployment fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style Service fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style NetworkPolicy fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style MCPPod fill:#7ed321,color:#fff
    style ConfigMaps fill:#e8e8e8
    style Secrets fill:#e8e8e8
    style Prometheus fill:#e8e8e8
